 beginners.</p></div><div class=\"fp-card\"><h3>Marcus Lee</h3><p>Pop &amp; jazz · session player · chords and improvisation.</p></div><div class=\"fp-card\"><h3>Ayumi Sato</h3><p>Kids &amp; teens · patient, funny, quick to praise.</p></div></div></section>","pricing":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Tuition</b></div><h1 style=\"font-weight:400\">Tuition</h1><p class=\"lead\">Cancel any month. First lesson is free.</p></div></section><section class=\"fp-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"fp-3\"><div class=\"fp-card\"><h3>Self-paced</h3><span class=\"p\">RM 49</span><ul><li>All video lessons</li><li>Metronome &amp; keyboard tools</li><li>Community forum</li></ul><a class=\"fp-btn o\" href=\"#\">Choose</a></div><div class=\"fp-card\" style=\"border-width:3px\"><h3>With a teacher</h3><span class=\"p\">RM 79</span><ul><li>Everything in Self-paced</li><li>Weekly recording feedback</li><li>Monthly live class</li></ul><a class=\"fp-btn\" href=\"#\">Start free lesson</a></div><div class=\"fp-card\"><h3>Private lessons</h3><span class=\"p\">RM 180</span><ul><li>4 live 30-minute lessons</li><li>Custom repertoire</li><li>Exam preparation</li></ul><a class=\"fp-btn o\" href=\"#\">Book</a></div></div></section>","faq":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>FAQ</b></div><h1 style=\"font-weight:400\">FAQ</h1></div></section><section class=\"fp-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"faq\"><details open><summary>Do I need a real piano?</summary><p>A 61-key keyboard is enough. Start with the on-page keyboard if you don't have one yet.</p></details><details><summary>Am I too old to start?</summary><p>Our oldest beginner was 78. Our average is 41.</p></details><details><summary>Can I learn to read music?</summary><p>Yes. Movement II is dedicated to it.</p></details></div></section>","privacy":"<section 